    {
      "threadId": "ou028y_xg63bi",
      "parameterId": "ou028y_xg63bi",
      "steps": [
        {
          "stepId": "maoa1p",
          "stepType": "ai.prompt.text",
          "title": "Write with AI",
          "adapter": "ai-text",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "input": "model",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "nvidia/nemotron-3.5-lightning"
            },
            {
              "input": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Please draft a professional and concise email to the following email recipient. \n\nSent to: {{yk5itn_each.Email details.Recipient}}\n\nSubject: {{yk5itn_each.Email details.Subject}}\n\nOutput should be a more polished and detailed version of the email body: {{yk5itn_each.Email details.Body}}\n\nV2 of Email Body:\n\nStart with the first version of the body of this email and rewrite in my voice. Here is the first version: {{yk5itn_each.Email details.Body}}\nCheck the transcription for additional context about this specific email to provide more details in the email body: {{trigger.File URL}}\n\nAbout me and my writing style:\n\nMy name is [YOUR NAME]. \nI am [YOUR TITLE] at [YOUR COMPANY]. \n[DESCRIBE YOUR WRITING STYLE, e.g. \"I am concise in my communication, polite but direct. I prefer shorter emails.\"]\n\nIf the email requires a meeting, propose a few times based on information in Google Calendar. { ai_tool }\n\nNever use em dashes.\n\nThe email should only include a Sent To, Subject, and Body. No sign-off at all. DO NOT end the email with a sign-off (e.g. Best, Thanks, Regards)."
            },
            {
              "input": "outputMode",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "text"
            },
            {
              "input": "reasoningEffort",
              "type": "string",
              "value": null
            },
            {
              "input": "maxTokens",
              "type": "number",
              "value": null
            }
          ],
          "outputSchema": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "message": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "message"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "axgv0j",
          "stepType": "gmail.saveAsDraft",
          "title": "Create draft",
          "adapter": "gmail-draft",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "input": "tos",
              "type": "array",
              "value": [
                {
                  "ref": "yk5itn_each.Email details.Recipient"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "input": "labels",
              "type": "array",
              "value": [
                "Inbox"
              ]
            },
            {
              "input": "subject",
              "type": "string",
              "value": {
                "ref": "yk5itn_each.Email details.Subject"
              }
            },
            {
              "input": "body",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{maoa1p.message}}"
            }
